OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKingspan fined bB,40m for
OL,4,Acompetition breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat required an investigation under
OL,7,FEuropean Union (EU) merger rules to
OL,8,Fmake sure it would not lead to
OL,9,Fsignificantly reduced competition. The
OL,10,Fcommission has concluded that Kingspan
OL,11,Fgave misleading information during that
OL,12,Fprocess.
OL,14,FIn a statement, Kingspan said it noted
OL,15,Fthe decision and would appeal it "in
OL,16,Ffull".
